      "values": {
        "en": "Product of Path Homotopy Classes",
        "zh-CN": "道路同伦类的乘法"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@X,Type),Type.annotation(@x,X),Type.annotation(@y,X),Type.annotation(@z,X),Type.annotation(@P,Path.Homotopic.Quotient(x,y)),Type.annotation(@Q,Path.Homotopic.Quotient(y,z))),def(Path.Homotopic.Quotient.trans(P,Q), , ))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "Given paths $f,g\\colon I\\to X$ with $f(1)=g(0)$, their **product** $f\\cdot g$ traverses first $f$ and then $g$ at twice the speed. The product respects homotopy classes, so $[f][g]=[f\\cdot g]$ is well defined (Hatcher p. 26).",
          "zh-CN": "设道路 $f,g\\colon I\\to X$ 满足 $f(1)=g(0)$，它们的**乘积** $f\\cdot g$ 以二倍速度先走完 $f$、再走完 $g$。乘积与同伦类相容，故 $[f][g]=[f\\cdot g]$ 有定义（Hatcher 第 26 页）。"
        }
      }
    },
